OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786124906
OL,3,CFleadh competitions get underway in
OL,4,CBelfast
OL,6,FFormal competitions got underway at
OL,7,Fthe Fleadh on Friday.
OL,9,FOver 5,000 competitors from 22
OL,10,Fcountries will be vying for All-
OL,11,FIreland titles, with a whole weekend
OL,12,Fof contests ahead showcasing the very
OL,13,Fbest in traditional music, song, and
OL,14,Fdance.
OL,16,FNew figures from Translink showed it
OL,17,Fhas delivered over one million
OL,18,Fpassenger journeys in total over the
OL,19,Ffirst five days of Fleadh.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/4
