CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786124906
OL,3,CFleadh competitions get underway in
OL,4,CBelfast
OL,6,FThe transport operator said that's an
OL,7,Fadditional 275,000 passenger journeys
OL,8,Fcompared with the equivalent period
OL,9,Flast year
OL,11,FTranslink said it expects thousands
OL,12,Fmore visitors for the Fleadh finale
OL,13,Fweekend.
OL,15,FMeanwhile Health Minister Mike Nesbitt
OL,16,Fhas praised volunteers, clinicians and
OL,17,Femergency responders supporting the
OL,18,FFleadh, which is expected to be
OL,19,FBelfast's largest ever event.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/4
