OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786124906
OL,3,CFleadh competitions get underway in
OL,4,CBelfast
OL,6,FHe said: "This is Belfast at its very
OL,7,Fbest.
OL,9,F"Behind the music and celebration is a
OL,10,Fmajor operation keeping people safe.
OL,11,FThe teamwork here is exceptional, with
OL,12,Fvolunteers, clinicians, ambulance
OL,13,Fcrews and university staff working
OL,14,Fside by side so people can enjoy the
OL,15,FFleadh with confidence.
OL,17,F"It is a strong example of care closer
OL,18,Fto home, treating people on site where
OL,19,Fappropriate and helping ease pressure
OL,20,Fon our hospitals and emergency
OL,21,Fdepartments."
OL,26,@nD@JOUyD@AOU}D@MO]
